{"u": "10771935715", "name": "MAHANAKHON RACING", "place": "104549080643413", "created": "2026-10-19", "updated": "2026-11-09T16:28:03.681Z", "genre": "Simulation", "subgenre": "", "desc": "🏍️ MAHANAKHON RACING [CODE MAHANAKHON]\n━━ How To Play ━━\n1. กด G เสกรถ\n2. เดินไปที่รถ กด E ขึ้นรถ\n3. กด R สตาร์ทเครื่อง\n4. กด K เก็บขาตั้ง\n5. กด W ออกรถได้เลย!\n\n━━ Drive ━━\nW = เร่ง\nS = เบรก (จอดแล้วกดค้าง = ถอยหลัง)\nShift = เบรก\nA / D = เลี้ยวซ้าย / ขวา\nCtrl (กดค้าง) = ยกล้อ\nQ = หมอบ\nSpace = ลงรถ\n\n━━ Light & Horn ━━\nZ / C = ไฟเลี้ยวซ้าย / ขวา\nX = ไฟฉุกเฉิน\nH = แตร\nL = ไฟแต่ง\n\n━━ Misc ━━\nV = เปลี่ยนมุมมอง\nM = กระจก\nP = แต่งรถ (ที่จุดแต่งรถ)\nN = วาร์ป\nF = โทรศัพท์\nJ (กดค้าง) = เก็บรถ\nY = กล้องอิสระ\n", "desc_hash": "873944adabd4", "max_players": 25, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 7909436, "favorites": 63662, "creator": {"id": 762937383, "name": "MAHANAKHON RACING", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-11-03": {"updated": "2026-11-03T22:18:28.768Z", "visits": 2436909, "fav": 18625, "up": 3053, "down": 65}, "2026-11-05": {"updated": "2026-11-05T13:58:06.315Z", "visits": 3523472, "fav": 28037, "up": 3895, "down": 112}, "2026-11-06": {"updated": "2026-11-06T18:00:54.397Z", "visits": 4185190, "fav": 33367, "up": 4350, "down": 127}, "2026-11-07": {"updated": "2026-11-07T17:58:51.878Z", "visits": 5375339, "fav": 45088, "up": 5275, "down": 172}, "2026-11-08": {"updated": "2026-11-08T16:10:31.114Z", "visits": 6727140, "fav": 56131, "up": 6255, "down": 216}, "2026-11-09": {"updated": "2026-11-09T16:28:03.681Z", "visits": 7909436, "fav": 63662, "up": 6966, "down": 236}}, "passes": [{"name": "VIP", "price": 199}, {"name": "X2 Money", "price": 299}], "products": [{"name": "10,000 Money", "price": 19}, {"name": "35,000 Money", "price": 59}, {"name": "80,000 Money", "price": 159}, {"name": "200,000 Money", "price": 399}, {"name": "500,000 Money", "price": 899}, {"name": "Gift VIP", "price": 199}, {"name": "Gift X2 Mone